{
  "_readme": [
    "Calibration set for the tune-name matcher (spec 037). Hand-labelled; see",
    "scripts/build_name_fixtures.py for how the candidate pairs were drawn (every",
    "within-tune name pair from the top ~200 tunes' alias sets in thesession.org's",
    "weekly data dump — 34,035 pairs, of which these are the ones that actually",
    "discriminate).",
    "",
    "The alias data CANNOT produce these labels. An alias group on thesession.org",
    "freely mixes spelling variants ('The Connaughtman's Rambles' / 'Connaught",
    "Rambles') with genuinely different names for the same tune ('The Kesh' / 'Na",
    "Ceis' / 'The Castle'). Suppressing the first and SHOWING the second is the whole",
    "job, so a human read them.",
    "",
    "The two errors are not symmetric, and the test bars say so:",
    "  variants -> matcher must say SAME. A miss shows a pointless 'aka The Silver",
    "              Spear'. A papercut. Bar: >= 95%.",
    "  distinct -> matcher must say DIFF. A miss HIDES from you that the tune has",
    "              another name, which defeats the feature. Bar: 100%, no exceptions.",
    "",
    "NOTE on the negative set: it is hand-picked, NOT sampled from pairs of different",
    "tunes. The same name legitimately belongs to several tunes (\"O'Keefe's\"), so a",
    "cross-tune identical pair is not a failure — 'same name' is the right answer",
    "there. In the product this never arises anyway: the drawer only ever compares",
    "names belonging to one tune_id.",
    "",
    "`functions` and `constants` (spec 052 §B5) pin each export exactly, in the shape",
    "every *.fixtures.json uses; tests/fixtures.test.js runs them, and the Swift package",
    "runs the same file. The calibration sets above are scored separately, by bar, in",
    "tests/namematch.test.js. What a port must match exactly:",
    "  - Normalization order: lowercase (JS toLowerCase); NFD then delete U+0300-U+036F;",
    "    delete apostrophes ' U+2019 U+02BC ` U+00B4; every run of non-[a-z0-9] becomes",
    "    one space; trim; drop a leading 'the ' and a trailing ' the'; peel trailing type",
    "    and noise words in list order until none peels (never down to nothing); then per",
    "    token: drop a final 's' and turn a final -ey/-ie/-y into 'i' (tokens longer than",
    "    2 only), then the SUBSTITUTIONS in order.",
    "  - normalizeName sorts tokens with JS default sort (UTF-16 code-unit order; tokens",
    "    are ASCII by then, so byte order agrees). parentheticals sorts the same way.",
    "  - diceCoefficient counts bigrams of UTF-16 code units, with multiplicity, and is",
    "    compared as an IEEE double (0.7951807228915663 is the exact expected value,",
    "    not a rounded one). Identical strings are 1 even when shorter than 2.",
    "  - digitRuns parses each run with parseInt, so leading zeros drop ('007' -> '7').",
    "  - sameName compares trimmed raw strings case-SENSITIVELY for the identity shortcut,",
    "    and falls back to a case-insensitive raw compare when either name normalizes to",
    "    nothing ('!!!')."
  ],

  "constants": {
    "DICE_THRESHOLD": 0.8
  },

  "functions": {
    "digitRuns": {
      "params": ["name"],
      "cases": [
        { "name": "one number", "input": { "name": "Paddy Fahey's No. 3" }, "expected": ["3"] },
        { "name": "hash number", "input": { "name": "Brosna #2, The" }, "expected": ["2"] },
        { "name": "none", "input": { "name": "The Kesh" }, "expected": [] },
        { "name": "leading zeros drop; order kept", "input": { "name": "No. 007 and 12" }, "expected": ["7", "12"] },
        { "name": "a decimal is two runs", "input": { "name": "1.5" }, "expected": ["1", "5"] },
        { "name": "empty", "input": { "name": "" }, "expected": [] },
        { "name": "null", "input": { "name": null }, "expected": [] }
      ]
    },

    "parentheticals": {
      "params": ["name"],
      "cases": [
        { "name": "one aside, punctuation stripped, lowercased", "input": { "name": "The Silver Spear (Kevin's)" }, "expected": ["kevins"] },
        { "name": "square brackets count; result is sorted", "input": { "name": "The Kesh (slow) [B]" }, "expected": ["b", "slow"] },
        { "name": "braces count", "input": { "name": "{x} (y)" }, "expected": ["x", "y"] },
        { "name": "an empty aside is dropped", "input": { "name": "Tune ()" }, "expected": [] },
        { "name": "inner punctuation is removed", "input": { "name": "Tune (A-B)" }, "expected": ["ab"] },
        { "name": "an unclosed aside is ignored", "input": { "name": "(a)(b" }, "expected": ["a"] },
        { "name": "unclosed only", "input": { "name": "Tune (unclosed" }, "expected": [] },
        { "name": "null", "input": { "name": null }, "expected": [] }
      ]
    },

    "normalizeName": {
      "params": ["name"],
      "cases": [
        { "name": "leading article", "input": { "name": "The Silver Spear" }, "expected": "silverspear" },
        { "name": "no article", "input": { "name": "Silver Spear" }, "expected": "silverspear" },
        { "name": "trailing type word and possessive", "input": { "name": "Cooley's Reel" }, "expected": "cooli" },
        { "name": "trailing ', The' and a doubled consonant", "input": { "name": "Butterfly, The" }, "expected": "buterfli" },
        { "name": "word order does not matter", "input": { "name": "Maggie Drowsy" }, "expected": "drowsimagi" },
        { "name": "stacked trailing noise and type", "input": { "name": "Paddy Fahey's Favourite Reel" }, "expected": "fahipadi" },
        { "name": "multi-word type peels first", "input": { "name": "Slip Jig" }, "expected": "slip" },
        { "name": "a bare type word is never peeled to nothing", "input": { "name": "Reel" }, "expected": "reel" },
        { "name": "a bare article is kept", "input": { "name": "The" }, "expected": "the" },
        { "name": "article then type", "input": { "name": "The Hornpipe" }, "expected": "hornpipe" },
        { "name": "spelling table and smart apostrophe", "input": { "name": "The Connaught Man’s Rambles" }, "expected": "conachtmanramble" },
        { "name": "diacritics fold", "input": { "name": "Laridé" }, "expected": "laride" },
        { "name": "sorted tokens (Irish title)", "input": { "name": "Is Ar Éirinn Ní Neosfainn Cé Hí" }, "expected": "arceeirinhiisneosfainni" },
        { "name": "-our- becomes -or-", "input": { "name": "The Humours Of Ballyloughlin" }, "expected": "balyloughlinhumorof" },
        { "name": "doubled vowels are not collapsed", "input": { "name": "Mrs. McLeod Of Raasay" }, "expected": "mcleodmrofraasai" },
        { "name": "plural", "input": { "name": "Kerrigans" }, "expected": "kerigan" },
        { "name": "empty", "input": { "name": "" }, "expected": "" },
        { "name": "null", "input": { "name": null }, "expected": "" }
      ]
    },

    "normalizeNameOrdered": {
      "params": ["name"],
      "cases": [
        { "name": "word order is kept", "input": { "name": "Maggie Drowsy" }, "expected": "magidrowsi" },
        { "name": "the other order", "input": { "name": "Drowsy Maggie" }, "expected": "drowsimagi" },
        { "name": "a compound split collapses", "input": { "name": "Rolling In The Rye Grass" }, "expected": "rolingintheryegras" },
        { "name": "stacked trailing noise and type", "input": { "name": "Paddy Fahey's Favourite Reel" }, "expected": "padifahi" },
        { "name": "Irish title", "input": { "name": "Is Ar Éirinn Ní Neosfainn Cé Hí" }, "expected": "isareirinnineosfaincehi" },
        { "name": "null", "input": { "name": null }, "expected": "" }
      ]
    },

    "diceCoefficient": {
      "params": ["a", "b"],
      "cases": [
        { "name": "identical", "input": { "a": "abcd", "b": "abcd" }, "expected": 1 },
        { "name": "disjoint", "input": { "a": "abcd", "b": "wxyz" }, "expected": 0 },
        { "name": "identical empty strings are 1", "input": { "a": "", "b": "" }, "expected": 1 },
        { "name": "a string shorter than 2 is 0", "input": { "a": "a", "b": "ab" }, "expected": 0 },
        { "name": "bigrams are ordered", "input": { "a": "ab", "b": "ba" }, "expected": 0 },
        { "name": "bigram multiplicity counts", "input": { "a": "aaaa", "b": "aaa" }, "expected": 0.8 },
        { "name": "night / nacht", "input": { "a": "night", "b": "nacht" }, "expected": 0.25 },
        { "name": "numbered variants score above the threshold", "input": { "a": "2fahinopadi", "b": "3fahinopadi" }, "expected": 0.9 },
        {
          "name": "mirror-image titles, just under the threshold",
          "input": { "a": "abretoncapefidlershetlandsymphonithetowelcome", "b": "bretoncapefidlerisleshetlandthetowelcome" },
          "expected": 0.7951807228915663
        }
      ]
    },

    "sameName": {
      "params": ["a", "b"],
      "cases": [
        { "name": "leading article", "input": { "a": "The Silver Spear", "b": "Silver Spear" }, "expected": true },
        { "name": "identical", "input": { "a": "O'Keefe's", "b": "O'Keefe's" }, "expected": true },
        { "name": "identical after trim", "input": { "a": "  The Kesh ", "b": "The Kesh" }, "expected": true },
        { "name": "case only", "input": { "a": "Reel", "b": "reel" }, "expected": true },
        { "name": "empty is never the same", "input": { "a": "", "b": "The Kesh" }, "expected": false },
        { "name": "null and absent", "input": { "a": null }, "expected": false },
        { "name": "normalizes to nothing: raw case-insensitive compare", "input": { "a": "!!!", "b": "???" }, "expected": false },
        { "name": "normalizes to nothing, identical", "input": { "a": "!!!", "b": "!!!" }, "expected": true },
        { "name": "digit guard beats the prefix rule", "input": { "a": "Paddy Fahey's", "b": "Paddy Fahey's No. 3" }, "expected": false },
        { "name": "different name", "input": { "a": "The Kesh", "b": "The Castle" }, "expected": false },
        { "name": "parenthetical guard", "input": { "a": "The Silver Spear (Kevin's)", "b": "The Silver Spear" }, "expected": false },
        { "name": "same parenthetical on both", "input": { "a": "Silver Spear (Kevin's)", "b": "The Silver Spear (Kevin's)" }, "expected": true },
        { "name": "prefix rule", "input": { "a": "Moll Roe", "b": "Moll Roe In The Morning" }, "expected": true },
        { "name": "trailing type word", "input": { "a": "Kesh", "b": "Kesh Jig" }, "expected": true },
        { "name": "prefix shorter than 5 does not count", "input": { "a": "Abcd", "b": "Abcd Efgh" }, "expected": false }
      ]
    },

    "meaningfullyDiffers": {
      "params": ["a", "b"],
      "cases": [
        { "name": "different name", "input": { "a": "The Kesh", "b": "The Castle" }, "expected": true },
        { "name": "spelling variant", "input": { "a": "The Kesh", "b": "Kesh" }, "expected": false },
        { "name": "empty differs", "input": { "a": "", "b": "The Kesh" }, "expected": true }
      ]
    },

    "pickAka": {
      "params": ["chain"],
      "cases": [
        { "name": "first name below the title that differs", "input": { "chain": ["The Burren", null, "Michael Creamer's", "Michael Creamer's Favourite"] }, "expected": "Michael Creamer's" },
        { "name": "walks past spelling variants", "input": { "chain": ["The Burren", null, "Burren", "Michael Creamer's"] }, "expected": "Michael Creamer's" },
        { "name": "nothing differs", "input": { "chain": ["The Silver Spear", null, "Silver Spear", "The Silver Spear"] }, "expected": null },
        { "name": "title is the first non-empty layer", "input": { "chain": [null, "Silver Spear (fast one)", null, "The Silver Spear"] }, "expected": "The Silver Spear" },
        { "name": "blank layers are skipped and the result is trimmed", "input": { "chain": ["  ", "The Kesh", "  The Castle  "] }, "expected": "The Castle" },
        { "name": "only a title", "input": { "chain": ["The Kesh"] }, "expected": null },
        { "name": "all null", "input": { "chain": [null, null] }, "expected": null },
        { "name": "empty chain", "input": { "chain": [] }, "expected": null },
        { "name": "null chain", "input": { "chain": null }, "expected": null }
      ]
    }
  },

  "variants": [
    { "a": "The Connacht Man's Rambles", "b": "The Connachtman's Rambles", "why": "compound split" },
    { "a": "The Connacht Man's Rambles", "b": "The Connachtmann's Rambles", "why": "doubled consonant" },
    { "a": "The Connacht Man's Rambles", "b": "Connaght Man's Rambles", "why": "spelling table" },
    { "a": "The Connacht Man's Rambles", "b": "The Connaught Man's Ramble", "why": "spelling + plural" },
    { "a": "The Connacht Man's Rambles", "b": "Connaught Rambles", "why": "dropped interior word (dice)" },
    { "a": "The Connacht Man's Rambles", "b": "The Connaughtman Rambles", "why": "compound + possessive" },
    { "a": "The Connacht Man's Rambles", "b": "Connaughtman's", "why": "short form (prefix)" },
    { "a": "The Connaughtman's Rambles", "b": "Connaughtman's Ramble", "why": "article + plural" },

    { "a": "The Swallow's Tail", "b": "The Swallow Tail", "why": "possessive" },
    { "a": "The Swallow's Tail", "b": "Swallows Tail", "why": "article + interior plural" },
    { "a": "The Swallowtail", "b": "The Swallow's Tail", "why": "compound split" },

    { "a": "Silver Spear", "b": "The Silver Spear", "why": "leading article — the case that motivated all this" },
    { "a": "Cooley's Reel", "b": "Cooley's", "why": "trailing tune type" },
    { "a": "Paddy Fahey's Favourite", "b": "Paddy Fahey's", "why": "trailing noise word" },
    { "a": "The Butterfly", "b": "Butterfly, The", "why": "trailing ', The'" },
    { "a": "Banish Misfortune", "b": "Banish Misfortune, The", "why": "trailing ', The'" },
    { "a": "The Star Of Munster", "b": "Star of Munster", "why": "article + case" },
    { "a": "Toss The Feathers", "b": "Toss the feathers", "why": "case only" },

    { "a": "Drowsy Maggie", "b": "Drowsie Maggie", "why": "token-final y/ie" },
    { "a": "Drowsey Maggie", "b": "Drowsy Maggy", "why": "token-final y/ey/ie, both tokens" },
    { "a": "Maggie Drowsy", "b": "Drowsy Maggie", "why": "word order" },

    { "a": "Ar Eirinn Ni Neosfainn Ce Hi", "b": "Is Ar Éirinn Ní Neosfainn Cé Hí", "why": "diacritics" },
    { "a": "Laridé", "b": "Laride", "why": "diacritics" },

    { "a": "Rolling In The Ryegrass", "b": "Rolling In The Rye Grass", "why": "compound split" },
    { "a": "Kerrigan's", "b": "Kerrigans", "why": "possessive" },
    { "a": "Mrs. McLeod Of Raasay", "b": "Mrs McLeod of Rasay", "why": "doubled vowel/consonant" },
    { "a": "The Flowers Of Edinburgh", "b": "Flowers Of Edinburgh, The", "why": "article position" },
    { "a": "The Humours Of Ballyloughlin", "b": "The Humors Of Ballyloughlin", "why": "-our-/-or-" },
    { "a": "Jenny Lind's Favorite Serenading", "b": "Jenny Lind's Favourite Serenading", "why": "-our-/-or-" },

    { "a": "Moll Roe", "b": "Moll Roe In The Morning", "why": "short form (prefix)" },
    { "a": "Jenny Lind", "b": "Jenny Lind's Favourite Serenading", "why": "short form (prefix)" },
    { "a": "Bonaparte's", "b": "Bonaparte Crossing The Rocky Mountains", "why": "short form (prefix)" },
    { "a": "Lord Moira's", "b": "Lord Moira's Welcome To Scotland", "why": "short form (prefix)" },
    { "a": "Pullet, The", "b": "The Pullet That Wants The Cock", "why": "short form (prefix)" }
  ],

  "distinct": [
    { "a": "Paddy Fahey's", "b": "Paddy Fahey's No. 3", "why": "digit guard beats the prefix rule" },
    { "a": "Paddy Fahey's No. 2", "b": "Paddy Fahey's No. 3", "why": "digit guard beats dice=0.90" },
    { "a": "Brosna", "b": "Brosna #2", "why": "digit guard" },
    { "a": "Ballydesmond No. 1", "b": "Ballydesmond No. 2", "why": "digit guard" },

    { "a": "The Kesh", "b": "The Castle", "why": "alternate names for one tune, genuinely different" },
    { "a": "The Kesh", "b": "Na Ceis", "why": "Irish-language name" },
    { "a": "The Kesh", "b": "Kincora, The", "why": "alternate name" },
    { "a": "Drowsy Maggie", "b": "Maggie Tuirseach", "why": "Irish-language name — must still show" },
    { "a": "The Silver Spear", "b": "Fisherman's Lilt", "why": "alternate name" },

    { "a": "Collins'", "b": "Daniel Michael Collins's Father's", "why": "sorted-prefix trap: shares one token only" },
    { "a": "The Coolin", "b": "Had You Seen My Sweet Coolin", "why": "shares one token only" },
    { "a": "First, The", "b": "My First Waltz With You", "why": "shares one token only" },
    { "a": "McCleod's", "b": "Mrs Mcleod Of Raasay", "why": "shares one token only" },
    { "a": "Manley's", "b": "Maurice Manley's", "why": "added forename is a different name" },
    { "a": "O'Keefe's", "b": "Padraigh O'Keefe's", "why": "added forename is a different name" },
    { "a": "The Federal Hornpipe", "b": "Get Out Of The Way Of The Federals", "why": "shares one token only" },

    {
      "a": "A Shetland Fiddler's Welcome To The Cape Breton Symphony",
      "b": "Cape Breton Fiddler's Welcome To The Shetland Isles, The",
      "why": "mirror-image titles: dice 0.7987, right under the 0.8 cliff. Do not lower the threshold."
    },
    { "a": "The Green Fields Of Rossbeigh", "b": "The Green Fields Of America", "why": "same frame, different place" },
    { "a": "Drag Her Round The Road", "b": "Drag Her Up The Road", "why": "one preposition apart, different tune" },
    { "a": "Indian Eat The Woodchuck", "b": "Indian Eat The Woodhen", "why": "one noun apart, different tune" },

    {
      "a": "The Silver Spear (Kevin's)",
      "b": "The Silver Spear",
      "why": "parenthetical guard beats the prefix rule — a bracketed aside is a deliberate disambiguation"
    },
    { "a": "Silver Spear (fast one)", "b": "The Silver Spear", "why": "parenthetical guard" },
    { "a": "The Kesh (slow)", "b": "The Kesh (fast)", "why": "parentheticals differ from each other" },

    { "a": "Toss The Feathers", "b": "The Sailor's Bonnet", "why": "unrelated" },
    { "a": "Cooley's", "b": "The Wise Maid", "why": "unrelated" },
    { "a": "The Butterfly", "b": "The Kesh", "why": "unrelated" },
    { "a": "Banish Misfortune", "b": "The Blarney Pilgrim", "why": "unrelated" },
    { "a": "The Musical Priest", "b": "The Blackthorn Stick", "why": "unrelated" }
  ]
}
